    },
    {
      "order": 2,
      "questionId": "qe-c08-0078",
      "sentenceId": "c08-s06-p086-05235-s009",
      "sentenceText": "Digging nine inches of a sloped, tree-root-filled, rock-hard clay-soil twenty-by-twenty-four-foot yard was hard.",
      "sentenceSha256": "c7a857f4e020d86da99742b89cd6ce247a544a7d56707ff1c2001727de7d6bcb",
      "readingUnitId": "c08-s06-p086-05235-r009-012",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c08-051",
      "parentFingerprint": "5288fdb2953c110b4efae389286a5623df0ab084af408fab972c2391a932f371",
      "passageSha256": "6fcf5aeb5880bbd5e7bc4cfc41c0648e87af351b65b15ad85eab309c06bce2d4",
      "pdfPages": [
        86,
        87
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 3,
      "questionId": "qe-c08-0079",
      "sentenceId": "c08-s06-p086-05235-s011",
      "sentenceText": "Our house sat on the top of a hill and our worksite was on the opposite side of the driveway, making transporting three hundred bags of gravel and sand with a wheelbarrow an insanely difficult task.",
      "sentenceSha256": "a278012ba327325fa2f05d82c4a4405cff1920629c0a88efac39d7549a90ca70",
      "readingUnitId": "c08-s06-p086-05235-r009-012",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c08-051",
      "parentFingerprint": "5288fdb2953c110b4efae389286a5623df0ab084af408fab972c2391a932f371",
      "passageSha256": "6fcf5aeb5880bbd5e7bc4cfc41c0648e87af351b65b15ad85eab309c06bce2d4",
      "pdfPages": [
        86,
        87
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 4,
      "questionId": "qe-c08-0080",
      "sentenceId": "c08-s06-p086-05235-s012",
      "sentenceText": "Not to mention carrying 2,000 bricks—it was literally backbreaking.",
      "sentenceSha256": "f35803a498729ca5a3fa4ee59a5280438d051d3fb7489edb6672126e71271883",
      "readingUnitId": "c08-s06-p086-05235-r009-012",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c08-051",
      "parentFingerprint": "5288fdb2953c110b4efae389286a5623df0ab084af408fab972c2391a932f371",
      "passageSha256": "6fcf5aeb5880bbd5e7bc4cfc41c0648e87af351b65b15ad85eab309c06bce2d4",
      "pdfPages": [
        86,
        87
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 5,
      "questionId": "qe-c08-0081",
      "sentenceId": "c08-s06-p086-05235-s013",
      "sentenceText": "There were many mornings when I was unable to get up because of the back pain.",
      "sentenceSha256": "75295e1ab4ff6838cfc601633ccb8f0810ad2a618b1a6847db823daec7e97e7f",
      "readingUnitId": "c08-s06-p086-05235-r013-016",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c08-052",
      "parentFingerprint": "b0b81d3a3f3003cd7ab734e153b7016accfbc15a8c9b5ac03e14dc00fcc86be3",
      "passageSha256": "d15de7402cc63615cf2a121a701e9ebf184f1b621ebf2bdcdf47f8d0b6a9bc83",
      "pdfPages": [
        87
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 6,
      "questionId": "qe-c08-0082",
      "sentenceId": "c08-s06-p086-05235-s017",
      "sentenceText": "It took us almost three months to complete.",
      "sentenceSha256": "2b34092ac25d5a177a8a54aa514047652c192eb33fb26bb66f51930d280df12b",
      "readingUnitId": "c08-s06-p086-05235-r017-019",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c08-053",
      "parentFingerprint": "513a5d50bb9ce0b807dde274953e99317f457119aaa1d302a1dace56d7bc5706",
      "passageSha256": "49d8ca69cf89fdf16b815b800b4e765c9fc0d0a56001a8141df39b31f6ae4e4b",
      "pdfPages": [
        87
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 7,
      "questionId": "qe-c08-0083",
      "sentenceId": "c08-s06-p086-05235-s018",
      "sentenceText": "In the end, the result was pretty good, but clearly not as good as what $9,000 would have accomplished in three to four days!",
      "sentenceSha256": "72595c527e53ac9b6a0c481f125a99c973f4e708bffa677caac9a60e0fc9a741",
      "readingUnitId": "c08-s06-p086-05235-r017-019",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c08-053",
      "parentFingerprint": "513a5d50bb9ce0b807dde274953e99317f457119aaa1d302a1dace56d7bc5706",
      "passageSha256": "49d8ca69cf89fdf16b815b800b4e765c9fc0d0a56001a8141df39b31f6ae4e4b",
      "pdfPages": [
        87
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 8,
      "questionId": "qe-c08-0084",
      "sentenceId": "c08-s06-p087-02700-s002",
      "sentenceText": "While digging one day, I saw a snake and screamed!",
      "sentenceSha256": "9148af7608c720d34ec7dd216634509058cf6c2c3167aee0dae42cb3a6a61de9",
      "readingUnitId": "c08-s06-p087-02700-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c08-054",
      "parentFingerprint": "5e2f73c1d78dbae52528af8ebced66e981b0e11d0583d90e76b35418b60be6e8",
      "passageSha256": "db3b524ec7d5c8c4eee4b117216fc5d76fb200c8bd708ac95b0a2071a179d6bd",
      "pdfPages": [
        87
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 9,
      "questionId": "qe-c08-0085",
      "sentenceId": "c08-s06-p087-02700-s003",
      "sentenceText": "I have a phobia of snakes, so I jumped, though it was just a garden snake in hibernation.",
      "sentenceSha256": "1918bc3f034872e934754be9e3e79f3b7ad0587807ed6282bb76bfe74de198f2",
      "readingUnitId": "c08-s06-p087-02700-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c08-054",
      "parentFingerprint": "5e2f73c1d78dbae52528af8ebced66e981b0e11d0583d90e76b35418b60be6e8",
      "passageSha256": "db3b524ec7d5c8c4eee4b117216fc5d76fb200c8bd708ac95b0a2071a179d6bd",
      "pdfPages": [
        87
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 10,
      "questionId": "qe-c08-0086",
      "sentenceId": "c08-s06-p087-02700-s004",
      "sentenceText": "Before our project, I had never laid bricks.",
      "sentenceSha256": "66923efcd46fb1538537a846293673d7ed505293b407b4079a7c9d4739948348",
      "readingUnitId": "c08-s06-p087-02700-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c08-054",
      "parentFingerprint": "5e2f73c1d78dbae52528af8ebced66e981b0e11d0583d90e76b35418b60be6e8",
      "passageSha256": "db3b524ec7d5c8c4eee4b117216fc5d76fb200c8bd708ac95b0a2071a179d6bd",
      "pdfPages": [
        87
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 11,
      "questionId": "qe-c08-0087",
      "sentenceId": "c08-s06-p087-02700-s005",
      "sentenceText": "In general, I am not very handy, so my self-esteem when it comes to handiness is pretty low.",
      "sentenceSha256": "4f5ce377866c73d739341cdbc6bf0b8ff101ae7401d919602f20fbaa12833622",
      "readingUnitId": "c08-s06-p087-02700-r005-008",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c08-055",
      "parentFingerprint": "ece69238e7fd868ca5baea0d1978b952709e4b7d4fe22b9de0fe5d4945d680a1",
      "passageSha256": "4bce828ae0c3da24d564f5422a13f2d1f093849688eb95a92c451a67049ff787",
      "pdfPages": [
        87
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 12,
      "questionId": "qe-c08-0088",
      "sentenceId": "c08-s06-p087-02700-s007",
      "sentenceText": "If we had hired someone to do everything for us, would I still be talking about it?",
      "sentenceSha256": "94c55efcf81b7a7f914c5adb25bf011076c324323ee340307c969c8865656ec4",
      "readingUnitId": "c08-s06-p087-02700-r005-008",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c08-055",
      "parentFingerprint": "ece69238e7fd868ca5baea0d1978b952709e4b7d4fe22b9de0fe5d4945d680a1",
      "passageSha256": "4bce828ae0c3da24d564f5422a13f2d1f093849688eb95a92c451a67049ff787",
      "pdfPages": [
        87
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 13,
      "questionId": "qe-c08-0089",
      "sentenceId": "c08-s06-p087-02700-s008",
      "sentenceText": "Probably not, because I wouldn’t have discovered the snake in hibernation, nor my unknown brick-edging skills.",
      "sentenceSha256": "af33ac77d8c23a19552eac154ef4adc5fc60b078a394e1cb96a24d88a2503410",
      "readingUnitId": "c08-s06-p087-02700-r005-008",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c08-055",
      "parentFingerprint": "ece69238e7fd868ca5baea0d1978b952709e4b7d4fe22b9de0fe5d4945d680a1",
      "passageSha256": "4bce828ae0c3da24d564f5422a13f2d1f093849688eb95a92c451a67049ff787",
      "pdfPages": [
        87
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 14,
      "questionId": "qe-c08-0090",
      "sentenceId": "c08-s06-p087-02700-s009",
      "sentenceText": "Yes, our patio project produced a lot of stress, physical pain, and unhappiness during those three months.",
      "sentenceSha256": "aa91b2afe8a573bd08fa411516d867d4e6a1b8b82a3eef330431a1a42edc4f95",
      "readingUnitId": "c08-s06-p087-02700-r009-011",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c08-056",
      "parentFingerprint": "ebad20bcc59a1100359d3cdddd34791dbead22b02635b9b261de0baf4706092a",
      "passageSha256": "4ce91178d6d48eda433e9afe97d983fc272461a8cb1c3d5089665f1321b1e461",
      "pdfPages": [
        87
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 15,
      "questionId": "qe-c08-0091",
      "sentenceId": "c08-s06-p087-05430-s001",
      "sentenceText": "Outsourcing routine cleaning would have no opportunity cost in terms of psychological richness.",
      "sentenceSha256": "91e2445e16554ddf01b8e0381262689bd5a9417666df52b2c67da60c9f4840df",
      "readingUnitId": "c08-s06-p087-05430-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c08-057",
      "parentFingerprint": "ca38f3e29590d2895eb3b12491d181f305c76a53b15dfdadeb790ee23425e44c",
      "passageSha256": "95f43958815c1fa29fae6ea0375e3683df8e9a8fd7676583365e89db73643816",
      "pdfPages": [
        87
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 16,
      "questionId": "qe-c08-0092",
      "sentenceId": "c08-s06-p087-05430-s003",
      "sentenceText": "So what’s the point, other than saving some money?",
      "sentenceSha256": "4674a06a4af207f4976f61212d808729211e9e09c1c837203a777ce774822553",
      "readingUnitId": "c08-s06-p087-05430-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c08-057",
      "parentFingerprint": "ca38f3e29590d2895eb3b12491d181f305c76a53b15dfdadeb790ee23425e44c",
      "passageSha256": "95f43958815c1fa29fae6ea0375e3683df8e9a8fd7676583365e89db73643816",
      "pdfPages": [
        87
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 17,
      "questionId": "qe-c08-0093",
      "sentenceId": "c08-s07-p088-00982-s002",
      "sentenceText": "Assembling a whole motorcycle is a lot more difficult and time-consuming than assembling a part of it.",
